      "content": "hey, i think something is seriously wrong with my digital footprint. i just tried to log into my old hobbyist forum and my account is just... gone. \"user not found\" even though i know the password is right. then i checked my secondary email and some folders are missing too. it feels way too coordinated for just \"glitches.\" can you help me look into this? i need to figure out if someone is actually scrubbing my data on purpose.",
