      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already tried the password reset and it says \"email not recognized.\" that's the thing, i've checked my logs and there's no record of a password change or a login from a new device. it's like the account didn't just get hacked, it's like it never existed in the first place. and the email thing... it's not just missing folders, it's like specific threads of conversations i had with certain people are just... vanished. if this was just a sync error or a bug, why would it be so surgical? it feels like someone is systematically removing my trail.",
